# Google Drive backup (server-backed OAuth)
#
# Create an OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID in the Google Cloud Console, enable the
# Drive API, and add these origins to the "Authorized redirect URIs" list:
#   http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback
#   https://<your-production-domain>/api/auth/callback
#   https://<project>-<branch>.vercel.app/api/auth/callback  (for preview deploys)
#
# Then set these three server-only env vars (never prefixed with VITE_):
#
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
TOKEN_ENC_KEY=
